      <br>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-9">
          <p>
            These variations of Roos Instruments logos are vital to our branding as it represents our unique identity
            as
            a company. The initials are in the body of a lowercase "i" completed with a blue sphere. Please click the
            "Download Media Kit" button to get a complete package. Always choose the best aspect ratio for the
            application. Raster and Vector formats are included.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-3 text-center">
          <a href="/mediakit/Roos_Media_Kit.zip" class="btn btn-primary" download="Roos_Media_Kit.zip"
            target="_blank">Download Media Kit</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3>Logos</h3>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-2">
          <h5>Tall</h5>
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <a href="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Matte_Tall_768x1536.png" aria-label="Download Tall Logo"
                download="RoosLogoOnly">
                <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Matte_Tall_768x1536.png" alt="Tall Logo Example">
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-2">
          <h5>Square</h5>
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <a href="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Matte_Square_1000x1000.png" aria-label="Download Square Logo"
                download="RoosLogoSquare">
                <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Matte_Square_1000x1000.png"
                  alt="Square Logo Example"></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-3">
          <h5>Rectangle</h5>
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <a href="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Matte_Rectangle_1536x768.png" aria-label="Download Rectagle Logo"
                download="RoosLogoRectangle">
                <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Matte_Rectangle_1536x768.png"
                  alt="Rectangle Logo Example"></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4">
          <h5>Wide</h5>
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <a href="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Matte_Wide_7280x900.png" aria-label="Download Wide Logo"
                download="RoosLogoWide">
                <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Matte_Wide_7280x900.png" alt="Wide Logo Example">
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-1">
          <h5>Icon</h5>
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/favicon-Matte.ico" alt="Wide Logo Example">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background-color: #F0F0F0; margin-bottom: 10px;" class="panel-heading">
        <div class="panel-title">
          <button class="link" aria-expanded="false" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#toggle-collapse">Legacy
            Logos
            &nbsp;<i class="fa fa-chevron-down"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="toggle-collapse" class="row panel-collapse collapse">
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-1">
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Classic_Tall_108x439.jpg" alt="Roos Logo Tall Classic">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-1">
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Gloss_Tall_1132_5373.png" alt="Roos Logo Tall Gloss">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-1">
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Gloss_White_134x613.png" alt="Roos Logo White Gloss">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-1">
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/favicon-gloss.ico" alt="Roos Logo Favicon Gloss">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4">
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Gloss_Wide_2220x783.jpg"
                alt="Roos Logo Wide Gloss Alternative">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4">
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Gloss_Wide_2220x317.jpg" alt="Roos Logo Wide Gloss">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4">
          <div class="parentbox">
            <div class="childbox">
              <img class="catalogImg" src="/mediakit/RoosLogo_Gloss_Wide_Transparent_2220x783.png"
                alt="Roos Logo Wide Gloss Transparent No Text">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <hr>
      <h3>Fonts</h3>
      <p style="font-family: Michroma;"><i class="fa fa-font" aria-hidden="true"></i>Michroma is used for Roos
        Instruments.</p>
      <p style="font-family: 'Source Sans Pro';"><i class="fa fa-font" aria-hidden="true"></i>Source Sans Pro is used
        for
        the tagline.</p>

      <!-- ==========================
    	CONTENT - End  (this is comment line can be excluded from actual content)
    =========================== -->
    </div>
</Base>
